This function iterates through all the agent instruction files and collects their purposes, and presents them in a list-like format.
The whole of each agent instruction file is that agent's purpose, so the entire file is used as the purpose text.
Make sure the agents are listed out like:
AGENT_TYPE: PURPOSE
-blank line-
NEXT AGENT_TYPE: PURPOSE
It is implemented as list_agent_types in swarm/functions.py and is reached through the >>LIST_AGENT_TYPES<< arrow.
